      },
      "hook": "Log 03. The pipeline has eleven valves. The plan has ten.",
      "social": {
        "body": "Eleven valves on a ten-valve line, and the eleventh one is warm."
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "text": "The site plan lists ten valves. The crew found eleven.",
          "viz": "statement",
          "kicker": "LOG 03 \u00b7 THE ELEVENTH VALVE",
          "transition": "cut"
        },
        {
          "id": "l2",
          "text": "The eleventh is not on any drawing, and it is the only one that is warm.",
          "viz": "stat",
          "value": 11,
          "unit": " valves",
          "label": "found on a line planned for ten",
          "kicker": "THE COUNT",
          "source": "fiction \u2014 invented for this story"
        },
        {
          "id": "l3",
          "text": "Everything else on site reads cold. The eleventh reads body temperature.",
          "viz": "compare",
          "kicker": "READINGS",
          "left": {
